# Content Model

Full detail: `docs/data-model/CONTENT-MODEL.md`, `BLOCK-SCHEMAS.md`, `PUBLISHING-LIFECYCLE.md`, `REPOSITORY-CONTRACTS.md`.

## Article (minimum)

`id`, `slug`, `title`, `summary`, `coverMediaId`, `categoryIds`, `tagIds`, `audienceIds`, `ownerId`, `authorId`, `status`, `blocks`, `relatedArticleIds`, `relatedPromptIds`, `relatedVideoIds`, `source`, `currentVersion`, `publishedVersion`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `publishedAt`, `reviewDueAt`, `revision`.

Statuses: `draft` | `published` | `hidden` | `archived` with documented transitions only.

Public may read **published** only (Phase 4+). Drafts/hidden are not public.

## Content block

Every block: `id`, `type`, `schemaVersion`, `data`, `settings`, `visibility`. Order = array order.

**Phase 3 schemas (all):** `heading`, `paragraph`, `list`, `table`, `image`, `gallery`, `video`, `file`, `button`, `link`, `quote`, `info`, `warning`, `tip`, `steps`, `checklist`, `faq`, `prompt`, `code`, `related-content`, `divider`, `table-of-contents`.

Prompt block references `PromptId`. No raw HTML / arbitrary CSS.

## Prompt / Video

Prompt: `promptText` required; no user-filled runtime data; publish needs `ownerId`.

Video: exactly one of `mediaId` | `externalUrl` (HTTPS); sorted chapters within duration.

## Source connection

`SourceReference`: `portal` | `google-docs` | `google-sheets` | `google-drive` | `manual-import`. No OAuth secrets in the reference.

## Version

Published changes create immutable versions: `entityId`, `versionNumber`, `snapshot`, `changeSummary`, `source`, `createdBy`, `createdAt`. Restore → new draft, no history mutation.

## Editor concurrency

Optimistic concurrency via explicit `revision` + `expectedRevision` on save. Never silently overwrite concurrent edits.

## Hardcoding

Never hardcode content entities in source. Seed/fixtures must be clearly labeled test-only and separated from production. In-memory repos are TEST_ONLY.
